  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Weave is riding accelerating adoption of its AI-powered platform among small and medium-sized healthcare practices. More than half of customer locations now actively use embedded AI tools, and a forthcoming omnichannel AI receptionist handling voice and text reinforces the company’s push into automated patient engagement. Record customer location additions in the quarter signal strong organic demand and broadening market acceptance, positioning Weave as a specialized vertical SaaS player in a niche where digitization of patient communications and payments is gaining urgency.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership points to disciplined business operations as the driver of accelerating growth and a landmark swing to non‑GAAP operating profitability. CEO Brett White highlighted record location additions and the broad AI feature adoption as evidence of effective platform execution. The team’s confidence is underscored by a raised full‑year outlook, aligning with bullish analyst commentary and validating the strategic focus on embedding AI deeper into the practice workflow to expand wallet share and entrench competitive differentiation.",
